Not all pets eat. You can tell pretty quickly by watching
them when there's a fresh corpse on the floor. IIRC a couatl
doesn't eat. That's good since it won't eat a corpse you
desperately wanted and it will never starve. That's bad
since there is no way to increase tameness so being on
separate levels gradually reduces tameness until it's not
your pet anymore.

It will follow you anyway. With no tools, just try to keep
it in sight. A tin whistle or a bell is helpful. A leash is
very effective and a magic whistle is the best.
